{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Evelyn clears her throat and says, \"Well, I must be going.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:01:07.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864265143164862464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Talia’s hat had hidden her eyes, but by the slight jump as Evelyn speaks, it’s not impossible that she had fallen asleep.\n“...right. Bye.”","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:02:11.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864265411129638953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Evelyn heads towards the door, but turns and sits back down at the table.","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:05:31.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864266252235178045","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Nevermind, I just remembered that I didn't need to go until later.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:06:02.081000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864266379145379870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“...oh.” Her drowsy eyes drift toward the window. “I usually do business here... after curfew. Looks different under the sun,” she idly comments, taking her bag into her lap and idly sorting through it, making the sound of crunching paper.","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:07:58.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864266866670698516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"So, uh, what kind of business do you do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:09:02.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864267135840288838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"As a few papers are flattened on the table for Talia’s own reference, contact is made, though with no particular intensity.\n“Smuggling. Crime. You know.”","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:12:18.437000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864267957696593920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Ah, I see. Do you have a way of staying out past curfew?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:15:18.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864268712034304002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"From an easily-accessible pocket, Talia produces a small card.\n“There was a printing error for counterfeits, so I bought it cheap. Works if they don’t read it.”\nThe card seems to be a curfew pass, but basic observation shows blatantly-wrong details: the card expires on “Three,” and the card proclaims itself as a “Cufew Pass.”","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:17:43.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864269322691149854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"You should get a better pass.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:18:36.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864269541608914954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"“Too expensive,” she dismisses, pocketing the card.\n“Besides. Nice income from mugging the ones who get wise. Satisfying, too.”","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:19:26.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864269753697960008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"So you're behind some of those attacks. Your secret is safe with me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T22:22:08.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864270434299281428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
